<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $60-1/8 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $60-1/8 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened $0-3/8 higher at $60-1/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>It later fell to $59-7/8. The latter price corresponded to about 305.94 markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
